    {
      "q": "What topics are covered in the Road User Handbook?",
      "a": "The handbook covers licence requirements, safe driving behaviour, sharing with other road users, road lanes and markings, parking, warnings and road hazards, vehicle registration, and penalties and fines for driving offences.",
